    {
      "id": "exit_mt_moon_east_to_cerulean",
      "goal_text": "Leave Mt Moon by its EAST exit and reach Cerulean City. The east exit is on B1F (not B2F): go back up from B2F, cross B1F to its far-east ladder/opening, which puts you on the EASTERN half of Route 4 \u2014 then head east to Cerulean. (Route 4's western half, where you entered, is walled off from Cerulean; you cannot get there overland.)",
      "done_when": {
        "map": "CERULEAN_CITY"
      },
      "escalation_rounds": 10,
      "macro_provenance": {
        "authored_by": "hand-seeded-subgoal",
        "note": "2026-08-12 PROBE FINDING: ROUTE_4 is ONE map id but two disconnected halves \u2014 from the west (entrance) side the east seam is unreachable (reachable=158 cells, east-edge reachable=[]). Mt Moon's only east exit is B1F's LAST_MAP warp at (27,3); 1F's LAST_MAP warps (14/15,35) are the ENTRANCE. The old exit_mt_moon_east ended on {map:ROUTE_4} which BOTH halves satisfy \u2014 so it 'succeeded' on the wrong side and reach_cerulean_city could never cross east."
      },
      "subgoal_provenance": {
